iven-names>RT</given-names></name><name><surname>Robbins</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Hendrix</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Frequency and predictive value of a mammographic recommendation for short-interval follow-up</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>2003</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>429</fpage><lpage>436</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||95|429||bib27|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12644536</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>